      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "WIKI  (primary KB)\nWikiPage / WikiRevision (immutable)\nWikiSection\nWikiLink  [[wikilinks]]\nWikiClaim (graded confidence)\nCitation  Claim \u2192 DocumentChunk[] | SourcePage\nSourcePage  [[Source:X]]\nAlias  surface_form \u2192 canonical_name\nHandEditMark  (protects analyst edits)\nRejectionFeedback (next-compile prompt)\nWikiIndex  (page-selector retrieval idx)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
